{"headword":"עֵד²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 17:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.17.6\">Dt 17:6</a> <strong>witness (</strong>prob. from <em>reiterating</em>, hence <em>emphatically affirming</em><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:48\" href=\"/Genesis.31.48\">Gn 31:48</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:13\" href=\"/Exodus.20.13\">Ex 20:16</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:19\" href=\"/Job.16.19\">Jb 16:19</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 35:30\" href=\"/Numbers.35.30\">Nu 35:30</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:12\" href=\"/Psalms.27.12\">ψ 27:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:11\" href=\"/Psalms.35.11\">35:11</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵדַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.10\">Is 43:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.12\">12</a>, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>witness, testimony, evidence</em>, of things: heap of stones <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:44\" href=\"/Genesis.31.44\">Gn 31:44</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:48\" href=\"/Genesis.31.48\">48</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:52\" href=\"/Genesis.31.52\">52</a> (JE), torn animal <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:12\" href=\"/Exodus.22.12\">Ex 22:12</a> (E), song of Moses <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.19\">Dt 31:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:21\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.21\">21</a> (R), law-book v <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 31:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.31.26\">26</a> (D), witness of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> against Israel; altar E. of Jordan, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּין</span>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:27\" href=\"/Joshua.22.27\">Jos 22:27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:28\" href=\"/Joshua.22.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 22:34\" href=\"/Joshua.22.34\">34</a> (P), cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 19:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.19.20\">Is 19:20</a>